<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Learn how enquiries and contact information are handled on the Arman Homes website, including the WhatsApp draft handoff and direct contact options."><PageHero title="Privacy Policy" eyebrow="Your Information" description="A clear explanation of the information used when you contact Arman Homes." /><section class="section"><div class="wrap-narrow prose"><p class="updated">Last updated: 17 October 2026</p><h2>Who We Are</h2><p>Arman Homes is a real estate agency based in Hinjewadi Marunji, Pune. For questions about your information, contact <a href="mailto:armanhomess@gmail.com">armanhomess@gmail.com</a> or <a href="tel:+919354210824">+91 9354210824</a>.</p><h2>Information You Choose to Share</h2><p>When making an enquiry, you may provide your name, phone number, email, property requirements, location, property details and message. Please share only what is needed for the enquiry and avoid sending identity documents, banking information or other sensitive information through this form.</p><h2>How the Enquiry Form Works</h2><p>Unless a direct enquiry service is configured, the form prepares a message in your browser and offers a link to WhatsApp. Nothing is sent by pressing “Prepare WhatsApp Enquiry”. Your details are included in the WhatsApp link only after you choose to open it; you then review and send the message in WhatsApp. WhatsApp handles information according to its own privacy policy.</p><p>If a direct enquiry service is enabled, the form is labelled “Send Enquiry”. It sends the details you enter to the agency’s configured service to handle your request. A confirmation is shown only after that service accepts the enquiry.</p><h2>How Your Information Is Used</h2><p>Information you send to Arman Homes is used to respond to your enquiry, understand your property requirements and discuss relevant next steps. Information may need to be shared with relevant service providers to handle that request. Contact us with questions before sharing details you consider sensitive.</p><h2>Website Storage and External Links</h2><p>This website does not set advertising cookies, use browser storage for enquiry details or include analytics tracking in its source. Hosting providers may process technical request information in their server logs. Enquiry text remains in the current form until you leave or reset the page; a prepared WhatsApp link contains the details you entered.</p><p>Phone, email, WhatsApp and map links open services outside this website. Their providers handle information according to their own policies. Map links show the general confirmed area rather than a precise business address.</p><h2>Retention and Your Requests</h2><p>Contact Arman Homes to ask about information you have sent, request a correction or ask for deletion. The agency can explain what it holds and whether any information needs to be retained for the enquiry or related obligations.</p><h2>Changes to This Policy</h2><p>This page may be updated when the website’s enquiry handling or services change. The update date above will reflect those changes.</p></div></section></Layout>
